Z||000006||Oreif||09-19-2001||09:51 PM||||The member that is custom making them is Coyote. He made mine and he's doing one for Haze. The Fiero Shop one is a kit but you have to do all the cutting and fiberglassing yourself. I think they'll sell you an entire hood. Also Archie sells a hood very simular to mine. <BR>Here is the link:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/warberhood.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/warberhood.htm</A> <P>You can make it about an inch deeper but you'll need to change a few things. Like the radiator overflow tank needs to move down. Also depending on the angle you may need to modify the front edge of the trunk where the spare tire sits.||||reg||1
